的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{h}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，封闭气体的温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。活塞与汽缸内壁间无摩擦且不漏气，外界大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现用电热丝（体积忽略不计）加热汽缸内的气体，已知气体的内能 U 与热力学温度 T 成正比，即 U=kT，k 为常数。\n（1）加热过程中活塞缓慢移动到与卡环接触前，封闭气体的内能（填空）（选填“增大”、“不变”或“减小”），单位时间撞击活塞单位面积上的分子数（填空）（选填“增加”、“不变”或“减少”）；\n（2）当活塞刚与卡环接触时，求缸内气体的温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n（3）活塞缓慢移动到与卡环刚接触的过程中，求电热丝放出的总热量 Q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/09b39e4b41317f8e48d9189ec65400398cdd0456e0b582b5cc2ecb414af18ae8.png","width":504,"height":324,"width_mm":59.073,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （1）增大；减少……（2分）\n(2) 气体做等压变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{sh}{T_{1}}=\\frac{\\frac{4}{3}sh}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=\\frac{4}{3}T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n（3）根据热力学第一定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = k(T_{1} - T_{2}) = \\frac{1}{3} kT_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -p_0\\Delta V = -\\frac{1}{3} p_0Sh"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\frac{1}{3} kT_{1} + \\frac{1}{3} p_0Sh"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611-q16","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9e280bd7677a4fb69b3e15f419d4707c230f96edef168cdb81d5e9324749d09f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）芯片制造中，离子注入是一道关键工序，需要把特定离子筛选出来再注入晶圆。某研究小组设计了如图所示的筛选装置，该装置由速度选择器和磁场偏转区组成，速度选择器内存在方向竖直向下、大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"E=1.0\\times10^{6}"},{"type":"text","value":" V/m 的匀强电场和方向垂直纸面向里、大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=0.5T"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场；磁场偏转区 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的宽度 d=0.8m，竖直方向足够长，该区域存在方向垂直纸面向外的磁场。现有一束比荷 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m}=1.0\\times10^{7}C/kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 、速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正离子沿速度选择器的中心线匀速通过，并垂直磁场偏转区的左边界进入。不计离子重力及相互作用。\n（1）求 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（2）若磁场偏转区的磁场为匀强磁场，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=0.2T"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求离子出射点到中心线的距离y和离子在磁场偏转区内的运动时间t；\n（3）若磁场偏转区的磁场为非匀强磁场，取离子进入磁场偏转区左边界的位置为坐标原点O，沿中心线建立x轴，向右为正方向，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=kx"},{"type":"text","value":" ，要使离子不从磁场偏转区的右边界射出，求比例系数k的取值范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/affd9db895cd30e04f5b130ef2cb51062aec559204747ec226179eaec4ee82c0.png","width":557,"height":468,"width_mm":65.329,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （1）离子沿中心线做匀速直线运动，电场力与洛伦兹力二力平衡"},{"type":"math","value":"qE = qv_{0}B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=2.0\\times10^{6}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（2）离子进入磁场偏转区后，做匀速圆周运动，洛伦兹力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{0}B_{2}=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"r=1.0m>0.8m"},{"type":"text","value":"，离子不能完成半圆，从磁场偏转区右边界射出……（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac {d}{r} = \\frac {4}{5}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 5 3 ^ {\\circ}"},{"type":"math","value":"y = r - r \\cos \\theta = 0. 4 \\mathrm{m}."},{"type":"figure","src":"images/248592eab6d8f33b0ad9d3f44eb4a80748d0ad76bc61e91ed18f9b45f511fa33.png","width":543,"height":435,"width_mm":68.8},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {\\theta}{\\omega} = \\frac {\\theta m}{q B _ {2}} = \\frac {5 3}{3 6} \\pi \\times 1 0 ^ {- 7} \\mathrm{s} \\approx 4. 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 7} \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）将离子速度沿水平"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"与竖直"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"方向分解。\n竖直方向上，洛伦兹力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{y} = qv_{x}B_{2} = qv_{x}kx"},{"type":"text","value":"取极短时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"，对竖直方向用动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{x}kx\\Delta t = m\\Delta v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）而"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = v_x\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = \\frac{qkx^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）离子到达最远水平位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\mathrm{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"时"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2mv_{0}}{qk}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，且"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m}\\leq d"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\geq0.625T/m"},{"type":"text","value":"（等号不取也给分） .....（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611-q17","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"262e05a700dd2bd2b7ef5aa781c537930eb6260c9b4a03bf32ec14b03ade30b4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）一游戏装置的结构示意图如图所示，该装置由粗糙斜面 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABB'A'"},{"type":"text","value":" 、四分之一光滑圆弧面 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCC'B'"},{"type":"text","value":" 和水平的、内有光滑平行滑轨的足够长导轨CD、 "},{"type":"math","value":"C'D'"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成，滑轨离导轨上表面的距离可忽略，导轨CD和 "},{"type":"math","value":"C'D'"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间是空隙。装置的A、B、C、D四点位于同一竖直平面，且B、C两点与导轨上表面位于同一高度，斜面与圆弧面相切于 "},{"type":"math","value":"BB'"},{"type":"text","value":" ；一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小球与长为l的轻杆Ⅰ相连，轻杆Ⅰ的另一端与质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块相连，物块套在可沿滑轨运动的水平轻杆Ⅱ上。游戏开始时，轻杆Ⅰ置于竖直状态，将一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_0"