{0}=(m_{1}+m_{2})v_{x共}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}gl+\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{1}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v_{x共}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\sqrt{7}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n（4）小球到达最低点时"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}v_{0}=m_{1}v_{1}'+m_{2}v_{2}'"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}g\\cdot2l+\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{1}'^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v_{2}'^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}'=(1-\\sqrt{5})m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}'=(1+\\sqrt{5})m/s"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}-m_{1}g=m_{1}\\frac{\\Delta v^{2}}{l}"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}+m_{2}g=F'"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"F'=12N"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n由牛顿第三定律可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F=F'=12N"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--ningbo-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bc03bdbb51bc7d83d567a381979c261df2f943aea78ae0e8b93968ebab95a174","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）如图1所示是一种演示电磁驱动现象的装置。小明同学试图对其进行定量研究，建立了如图2所示柱状鼠笼模型，俯视图如图3所示，鼠笼由12根金属杆和上、下两个金属圆环连接而成，且接触良好。每根金属杆的长度均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两圆环半径均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻不计，金属杆与圆环的总质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" （鼠笼的其余部分均由轻质绝缘材料连接），鼠笼可绕竖直通过圆环圆心的转轴 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":" 转动，鼠笼外侧的两磁极装有极靴，鼠笼中间还有一个用软铁制成的圆柱，极靴与圆柱间的磁场都沿半径方向，该磁场区域所对的圆心角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":" （不考虑磁场的边界效应和其余空间的磁场），金属杆经过处的磁场的磁感应强度大小均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 。鼠笼初始时静止，现在外力作用下使磁体以角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针（俯视）匀速转动，从而驱动鼠笼转动，鼠笼转动时始终受到与金属杆线速度大小成正比、方向相反的总阻力 "},{"type":"math","value":"f = kv"},{"type":"text","value":" 作用， "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为常数，其余阻力忽略不计。\n（1）鼠笼刚开始转动时，\n①求此时处于磁场中的金属杆 CD 产生的电动势大小；\n②判断不在磁场区域内的其余10根金属杆上有无电流；\n（2）求鼠笼的切向最大加速度和最大角速度；\n（3）若经时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 鼠笼的角速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{\\mathrm{t}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求该过程鼠笼转过的角度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/19bcc93a6385db45bf146cbbefca227de4c17d79cf61981a2ac53c768224b283.png","width":314,"height":426,"width_mm":36.805,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c2914adfca407120af57fb5b5e517d0e445c7680ff48cb616cc34935c5791230.png","width":428,"height":541,"width_mm":50.239,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8557b574d7fae025efd59d3526ca767ffda4cda2a77c0d9b83cebae681ad621d.png","width":530,"height":381,"width_mm":62.201,"row_group":"ningbo-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图3\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(1) ①"},{"type":"math","value":"E = Bl\\omega_{0}r"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n②无 (1分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"2F_{A} - kv = 2F_{A} - k\\omega r = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A} = BIl"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"E = Bl(\\omega_{0} - \\omega)r"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n由上述可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}(\\omega_{0} - \\omega)r}{R} - k\\omega r = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n对上式，当"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，加速度最大，最大加速度"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{\\mathrm{m}} = \\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}\\omega_{0}r}{mR}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n对上式，当"},{"type":"math","value":"a = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，角速度最大，最大角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{\\mathrm{m}} = \\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}\\omega_{0}}{2B^{2}l^{2} + kR}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3) 在运动方向上由动量定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}(\\omega_{0} - \\omega)r}{R}\\Delta t - k\\omega r\\Delta t = m\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n对上式求和，得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}\\omega_{0}r}{R} t - \\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}r}{R}\\theta - kr\\theta = m\\omega_{t}r"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n化简得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = \\frac{2B^{2}l^{2}\\omega_{0}t - m\\omega_{t}R}{2B^{2}l^{2} + kR}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}}]}
